          "distinct": true,
          "id": "4c091b17dc978a44251a521b547acb5fd8bb72dc",
          "message": "perf: Use the cheapest possible aggregate for `COUNT(*)`. (#6463)\n\n## What\n\nImplement `COUNT(*)` using `FilterAggregation::new(\"*\")`, which is\ninterpreted as `AllQuery`, which fetches no columns or posting lists,\nand only inspects the liveness bitset.\n\n## Why\n\nPreviously we were using `CountAggregation { field: CTID_FIELD_NAME }`,\nwhich forced the `ctid` column to be fetched. While the `ctid` column is\nalready (optionally) fetched during visibility checks, we do not want it\nto be fetched a second time.\n\n## Tests\n\nMany regress changes.",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-23T21:31:00-07:00",
          "tree_id": "df777b9aad1757a43f1d3d647de14c552293f9f5",
