          "message": "chore: bump Tantivy for batched term lookups (#6522)\n\n## What\n\nBump Tantivy from `320be96ee` to `f0a8e6b9a`, the current Tantivy main.\n\n## Why\n\nIncludes [batched term dictionary lookups\n(#242)](https://github.com/paradedb/tantivy/pull/242) and [the match-all\naggregation shortcut\n(#258)](https://github.com/paradedb/tantivy/pull/258).\n\n## How\n\nUpdate all four Tantivy Git pins together and refresh their lockfile\nentries. No unrelated dependency updates.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Pre-commit checks passed.\n- Verified both changed files contain only the Git revision\nsubstitution.\n- `cargo check -p pg_search --locked --no-default-features --features\npg18,io_stats` passed (PostgreSQL 18).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: paradedb-github-bot[bot] <282009505+paradedb-github-bot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
